menu "Zigbee NCP over TCP"
    config ZBOSS_NCP_TCP_PORT
        int "TCP port the NCP serves its host on"
        range 1 65535
        default 6638
        help
            Zigbee2MQTT connects with adapter "zboss" and port
            "tcp://<device>:<this port>". 6638 is what busware's Wi-Fi build
            of esp-coordinator uses, so a Zigbee2MQTT already set up for one
            needs only the address changed.
endmenu
